Chromium 156.0.8078.35 + the later changes of its release branch, for the
156.0.8078.35 tree that chromium-156.0.8078.12-to-156.0.8078.35.patch makes.

156.0.8078.35 is the newest 156 release, but its branch has gained fixes
since, among them security fixes that Stable 155.0.8059.84 and Extended
Stable 152.0.7977.169 ship (CVE-2026-110913, CVE-2026-110918, CVE-2026-110922)
and fixes for 156-only bugs that will be credited in the 156 Stable notes.

Generated from the upstream diffs chromium/src
refs/tags/156.0.8078.35..1266e7495a0703d7361f23fd13ccad8067c00714 (refs/branch-heads/8078 on
2026-10-16, 59 commits) and the dependencies whose DEPS revision changed (v8,
third_party/devtools-frontend/src), as served by Gitiles, with the same
rules as chromium-156.0.8078.12-to-156.0.8078.35.patch: left out are files
not in the release tarball, iOS/Android/ChromeOS/Mac/Windows-only files,
tests and docs, translations other than en-GB, PGO/AFDO/orderfile pointers,
ChromeOS LKGM and infra files, submodule pointer updates. chrome/VERSION, DEPS and the generated
LASTCHANGE files stay at 156.0.8078.35.

Commits contributing to it (oldest first; "Roll commits from side projects"
are the v8 and devtools-frontend updates):
